---
description: Vue Router guard and route metadata rules
globs: src/router/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Router

- Use computed store properties in router guards, such as `hasActiveGame`,
  instead of direct state property checks.
- Keep route names centralized in `src/router/routerName.ts`.
- Prefer extracting complex guard logic to composables when it needs tests.
- Use route metadata for route-level requirements such as active players or an
  active game.
